{"id":"48ab8e892a346161","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-chowmean.md","title":"Average modified Chow power under a random threshold","display":"thm-chowmean — Average modified Chow power under a random threshold","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-chowmean","aliases":["27-thm-chowmean"],"display":"thm-chowmean — Average modified Chow power under a random threshold","depends_on":["[[27-df-chow]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.6.2 Theorem 9.25","source_printed_pages":"432–433","source_pdf_pages":"456–457","verification_status":"source-statement-and-interval-counting-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-chowmean"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-chowmean</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-chowmean — Average modified Chow power under a random threshold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.6.2 Theorem 9.25"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"432–433"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"456–457"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-interval-counting-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n\">\\(w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\sum_iw_i&gt;0\">\\(W=\\sum_iw_i&gt;0\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in[0,W]\">\\(t\\in[0,W]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_t\">\\(f_t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span> 由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i,c_0\">\\(c_i,c_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a>，其函数输入属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>；积分是有界阶梯函数的通常实积分，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_t(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;w\\cdot x&gt;t,\\\\0&amp;w\\cdot x\\le t\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in[0,W],\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_t(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;w\\cdot x&gt;t,\\\\0&amp;w\\cdot x\\le t\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in[0,W],\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i(q)\\coloneqq2c_i(q)-c_0(q)\\quad(q\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n},\\ i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_i(q)\\coloneqq2c_i(q)-c_0(q)\\quad(q\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n},\\ i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac1W\\int_0^W\\pi_i(f_t)\\,dt=2^{n-1}\\frac{w_i}{W}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac1W\\int_0^W\\pi_i(f_t)\\,dt=2^{n-1}\\frac{w_i}{W}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.25，印刷 pp.432–433／PDF pp.456–457。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=0\">\\(x_i=0\\)</span> 输入在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[w\\cdot x,w\\cdot x+w_i)\">\\([w\\cdot x,w\\cdot x+w_i)\\)</span> 上成为摆动，长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_i\">\\(w_i\\)</span>，且包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,W]\">\\([0,W]\\)</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n-1}\">\\(2^{n-1}\\)</span> 个指标函数求和再积分即可。排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=0\">\\(W=0\\)</span>；结论为平均分量，未推出某个阈值使整向量严格成比例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-chow]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n$，$W=\\sum_iw_i>0$；对 $t\\in[0,W]$，$f_t$ 与 $\\pi_i$ 由下式构造；$c_i,c_0$ 见 [[27-df-chow]]，其函数输入属于 $\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$；积分是有界阶梯函数的通常实积分，$i\\in[n]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\sum_iw_i>0","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in[0,W]","display":false},{"tex":"f_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i","display":false},{"tex":"c_i,c_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"f_t(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&w\\cdot x>t,\\\\0&w\\cdot x\\le t\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in[0,W],\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_i(q)\\coloneqq2c_i(q)-c_0(q)\\quad(q\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n},\\ i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac1W\\int_0^W\\pi_i(f_t)\\,dt=2^{n-1}\\frac{w_i}{W}.","display":true},{"tex":"x_i=0","display":false},{"tex":"[w\\cdot x,w\\cdot x+w_i)","display":false},{"tex":"w_i","display":false},{"tex":"[0,W]","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"W=0","display":false}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-chowmean|thm-chowmean — Average modified Chow power under a random threshold]]"}],"outgoing":["260aad3bc2408854"]}